B.awX=new A.jZ("Definitions come from Webster\u2019s Revised Unabridged Dictionary (G. & C. Merriam Co., 1913), a public-domain work, via the Project Gutenberg text (gutenberg.org/ebooks/29765) as parsed by the WebstersEnglishDictionary project on GitHub. Definitions are shortened to their first senses; being from 1913, they reflect the usage and attitudes of their time.",null)
B.awY=new A.jZ("All books come from Standard Ebooks (standardebooks.org), a volunteer project that produces carefully proofread, beautifully formatted editions of public-domain works.",null)
B.awZ=new A.jZ("Recordings are LibriVox (librivox.org) public-domain audiobooks read by volunteers, streamed from the Internet Archive (archive.org); each player names its reader. Read-along timing for a few pilot chapters was produced on our side by automatically aligning the recording with the text, so it can drift by a word or two. Liber et Libri is not affiliated with LibriVox or the Internet Archive.",null)
B.ax_=new A.jZ("For reading in the app, the text has been converted to plain paragraphs; endnotes and some typographic details were left out.",null)
